<TITLE>Millimeter Wave</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Millimeter waves are radio waves in a very high frequency band from 30GHz to 300GHz, with an extremely short wavelength in a vacuum of 1 to 10mm. Millimeter waves are not easily affected by conditions such as rain, fog or snow, and provide excellent object recognition performance. A 76GHz band radar is used in the pre-crash safety system.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
